Package: aquats
Type: Package
Title: Robust Ecological and Fisheries Data Analysis and Visualization
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Ataher",
                  family = "Ali",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "ataher.cu.ms@gmail.com")
Description: A comprehensive statistical and visualization toolkit tailored 
    for fisheries science, stock assessment workflows, and aquatic ecology. 
    It provides streamlined wrappers for univariate and factorial ANOVA, 
    ANCOVA, MANOVA, generalized linear models, non-linear morphometric 
    regressions with embedded algebraic equations, ordination techniques 
    (NMDS, PCA, RDA, db-RDA, hierarchical clustering), correlation heatmaps, 
    integrated Mantel test network linkages, alpha diversity indices, 
    species accumulation curves, water quality indices (WAWQI), heavy metal 
    ecotoxicological contamination indices, and multi-factor longitudinal 
    time-series tracking with uncertainty ribbons.
